### Configuration Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@contentType = application/json

# ==========================================
# SUPER ADMIN - PROVISIONING
# ==========================================

### Provisionner une nouvelle entreprise (Le test complet)
POST {{baseUrl}}/super-admin/provision
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "companyName": "Restaurant Le Gourmet",
  "operatingHours": {
    "monday": { "open": "09:00", "close": "23:00" },
    "tuesday": { "open": "09:00", "close": "23:00" },
    "wednesday": { "open": "09:00", "close": "23:00" },
    "thursday": { "open": "09:00", "close": "23:00" },
    "friday": { "open": "09:00", "close": "00:00" },
    "saturday": { "open": "10:00", "close": "00:00" },
    "sunday": { "open": "10:00", "close": "21:00" }
  },
  "managerFirstName": "Alice",
  "managerLastName": "Chef",
  "managerEmail": "alice@legourmet.com",
  "managerPhone": "514-123-4567",
  "roles": [
    {
      "title": "Cuisinier",
      "baseHourlyRate": 22.00,
      "staffingNeeds": { "monday": 2, "friday": 4, "saturday": 4 }
    },
    {
      "title": "Serveur",
      "baseHourlyRate": 15.00,
      "staffingNeeds": { "monday": 1, "friday": 3, "saturday": 3 }
    }
  ]
}

### Voir toutes les entreprises créées
GET {{baseUrl}}/super-admin/companies
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### Voir les détails d'une entreprise spécifique (Remplace l'ID par celui généré)
GET {{baseUrl}}/super-admin/company/1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}